sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Mini App
  participant V as HTTP boundary
  participant S as Domain service
  participant D as Database
  participant P as Publication processor
  participant G as Google
  U->>V: Signed identity, request key, expected revision
  V->>S: Authorized scoped command
  S->>D: Lock record; validate revision and state
  S->>D: Commit state, event and publication reservation
  S-->>U: Saved plus publication state
  P->>D: Claim fenced operation lease
  P->>G: Publish current authorized projection
  P->>D: Persist success, retry or terminal failure
